[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":110},["ShallowReactive",2],{"news-detail-ardova-plc-graduate-trainee-program-2026-how-to-apply-280":3},{"news":4,"more":27},{"id":5,"slug":6,"title":7,"content":8,"authorName":9,"authorId":10,"status":11,"recommended":12,"datePosted":13,"deadline":14,"images":15,"notifiedAt":14,"notifiedBy":14,"createdAt":13,"updatedAt":21,"categories":22,"readTime":24},280,"ardova-plc-graduate-trainee-program-2026-how-to-apply-280","Ardova Plc Graduate Trainee Program 2026: How To Apply","\u003Cp>Ardova PLC Graduate Trainee Program offers participants business exposure, professional development, mentorship, and hands-on experience across operational and commercial areas of the organization.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>This early-career development initiative aims to find, mentor, and fast-track high-potential Nigerian graduates into tomorrow’s leadership roles across Africa’s changing energy sector.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Ardova PLC Graduate Trainee Program Abstract\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Host: Ardova PLC\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Location: Nigeria\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Category: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Finternships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Internships\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Ftrainings\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Trainings\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Benefits:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Training\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Mentorship\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Hands-on Experience\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Eligibility: Nigeria\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Deadline: June 10, 2026\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>AP Graduate Trainee Program 2026 Details\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Ardova PLC Graduate Trainee Program offers participants business exposure, professional development, mentorship, and hands-on experience across operational and commercial areas of the organization.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>This early-career development initiative aims to find, mentor, and fast-track high-potential Nigerian graduates into tomorrow’s leadership roles across Africa’s changing energy sector.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Successful candidates will gain industry experience, leadership development, and the opportunity to build rewarding careers within one of Nigeria’s leading energy companies.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Ardova PLC Graduate Trainee Program 2026 Benefits\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The Ardova PLC Graduate Trainee Progra\u003Cstrong>m\u003C\u002Fstrong> offers the following benefits;\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Structured graduate trainee programme\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Industry-leading mentorship and development\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Practical workplace experience\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Exposure to Nigeria’s energy sector\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Leadership and career development opportunities\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Professional and technical skills enhancement\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Long-term career growth potential\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>AP Graduate Trainee Program Requirements\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To be eligible for the AP Graduate Trainee Program, applicants must satisfy the following conditions:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>hold a minimum of Bachelor’s Degree with Second Class Upper (2:1)\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Engineering disciplines including:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Chemical Engineering\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Petroleum Engineering\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Mechanical Engineering\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Metallurgical Engineering\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Electrical Engineering\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Business-related disciplines are also eligible\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Minimum of five (5) O’Level credits including English Language and Mathematics in one sitting\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Must have completed NYSC\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Valid NYSC discharge certificate required\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Willingness to relocate anywhere within Nigeria\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>AP Graduate Trainee Program 2026 Required Documents\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>While applying for the AP Graduate Trainee Program 2026, you will be required to submit the following documents;\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>O’ Level Results\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Bachelor’s Degree Certificate\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>NYSC Certificate\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Updated Curriculum Vitae (CV)\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>How To Apply for Ardova PLC Graduate Trainee Program\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To apply for the Ardova PLC Graduate Trainee Program 2026, follow the instructions we have outlined below; \u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Read the information we have provided on this webpage and ensure your eligibility\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Prepare the required documents\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Complete all required personal information accurately.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Input your correct academic details, grades, and NYSC completion status.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Double-check that your phone number and email address are spelled correctly, as these will be used for test invitations.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Upload your CV and certificates in the requested file formats (PDF).\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Review all entered data for errors.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>APPLY HERE: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Ftally.so\u002Fr\u002FODj2Wa\">https:\u002F\u002Ftally.so\u002Fr\u002FODj2Wa\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>","Linkskool",16,"published",0,"2026-06-07 09:54:15",null,[16],{"fileName":17,"oldFileName":17,"type":18,"file":19,"url":20},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fardova-plc-graduate-trainee-program-2026-how-to-apply\u002F6a2531b7104a55.51052352_screenshot 2026-06-07 094545.png","image","","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fardova-plc-graduate-trainee-program-2026-how-to-apply\u002F6a2531b7104a55.51052352_screenshot%202026-06-07%20094545.png","2026-06-24 11:55:43",[23],{"id":24,"name":25,"createdAt":26},2,"Opportunities","2026-01-07 13:35:07",[28,38,48,57,66,75,84,93,101],{"id":29,"slug":30,"title":31,"images":32,"datePosted":36,"authorName":37},305,"dartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity","Dartmouth College Kings Scholarship Usa 2026: Fully Funded Opportunity",[33],{"fileName":34,"oldFileName":34,"type":18,"file":19,"url":35},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fdartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F6a3c3537be16a2.95289717_screenshot 2026-06-24 204255.png","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fdartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F6a3c3537be16a2.95289717_screenshot%202026-06-24%202